Table Data:
Entity, Value
Not much orno confidence atall, 71
Some confidence, 27
a lot of confidence, 2

User Instruction:
Expand the X-axis horizontally to separate the bars and prevent the labels 'A lot of confidence' and 'Some confidence' from overlapping.

