Question:
Suppose the energy production from Solar doubles from 700 TWh to 1400 TWh, while all other sources remain constant. By how many percentage points does the renewable energy's share of total energy production increase?

Table Data:
{"Category": ["Coal", "Natural Gas", "Nuclear", "Hydroelectric", "Wind", "Solar", "Biomass"], "Value": [3000, 2500, 1500, 1000, 800, 700, 500]}

User Instruction:
Change the color of the 'undefined' legend entry to blue to clearly distinguish it from the 'Before doubling' orange, as they are currently identical.

Base Code:
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": {
    "values": [
      {"Category": "Coal", "Value": 3000},
      {"Category": "Natural Gas", "Value": 2500},
      {"Category": "Nuclear", "Value": 1500},
      {"Category": "Hydroelectric", "Value": 1000},
      {"Category": "Wind", "Value": 800},
      {"Category": "Solar", "Value": 1400},
      {"Category": "Biomass", "Value": 500}
    ]
  },
  "transform": [
    {
      "calculate": "datum.Category == 'Hydroelectric' || datum.Category == 'Wind' || datum.Category == 'Solar' || datum.Category == 'Biomass' ? datum.Value : 0",
      "as": "Renewable"
    },
    {
      "aggregate": [{"op": "sum", "field": "Value", "as": "Total"}]
    },
    {
      "aggregate": [{"op": "sum", "field": "Renewable", "as": "RenewableTotal"}]
    },
    {
      "calculate": "(datum.RenewableTotal / datum.Total) * 100",
      "as": "RenewablePercentage"
    }
  ],
  "mark": "bar",
  "encoding": {
    "x": {"field": "Category", "type": "nominal", "axis": {"labelAngle": -45}},
    "y": {"field": "Value", "type": "quantitative"},
    "color": {
      "field": "Category",
      "type": "nominal",
      "scale": {
        "domain": ["Coal", "Natural Gas", "Nuclear", "Hydroelectric", "Wind", "Solar", "Biomass"],
        "range": ["#a6cee3", "#1f78b4", "#b2df8a", "#33a02c", "#fb9a99", "#e31a1c", "#fdbf6f"]
      }
    }
  },
  "title": "Energy Production by Source with Increased Solar Output",
  "config": {
    "axis": {"labelFontSize": 12, "titleFontSize": 14},
    "title": {"fontSize": 16, "anchor": "start"}
  }
}

