The x-axis category labels are overlapping due to limited horizontal spacing, and the chart area is too narrow with excessive empty space on the right. Fix the layout by widening the chart, increasing spacing between the bars and x-axis categories, and keeping the two bars clearly distinguishable with separate colors without changing the data or chart type.

